/*
 *  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 *  NOTE for the GTH rung: the config register file implements a 512-BYTE window
 *  (pcie_config_reg.sv s_axil_*addr are [8:0]) and the enumeration engine emits
 *  DW register numbers 0x00-0x09 with the EXTENDED register number always 0 --
 *  max byte offset 0x24.  Measured at #7g-1, both < 0x200, which is why the
 *  32->9 narrowing above is waived rather than fixed.  EXTENDED CONFIG SPACE IS
 *  NOT IMPLEMENTED; anything above 0xFF aliases.  Revisit before the GTH rung.
 *  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 */
